<a href="https://mybrandplease.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/E-Catalouge_mybrandplease.com_.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="a11y-new-window-external-message">For full list of available range, click here.</a>";}i:193;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:324;s:4:"slug";s:21:"aftershave-power-balm";s:4:"name";s:21:"Aftershave Power Balm";s:8:"category";s:10:"men-s-care";s:11:"subcategory";s:0:"";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";d:4.5;s:7:"reviews";i:0;s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:70:"uploads/products/aftershave-power-balm/aftershave-power-balm-9092.webp";s:11:"description";s:845:"Post shave skin care is the defining factor when clear, even and toned skin is the desired result. This aftershave balm nourishes and seals roughened skin and open pores. Skin is softened and soothed, eliminating post shave irritation. MSM, Vitamin E, Green Tea, Chamomile and Reishi Mushroom all work synergistically to cool and calm sensitive skin. Coconut, Jojoba and Apricot Kernel Oils lightly moisturize without a greasy residue. Soothing Aloe Vera takes the red out and adds the firm taught and toned factor right back in. Your happy end result is smooth and soft, bracing and attractive skin.

