";s:11:"description";s:1052:"Antioxidant skin care protocols are the tried and true approach to minimizing the environmental damage that prematurely ages skin. Free radical damage, called oxidation, shows up in our skin as wrinkles and discoloration. Our Super Fruits Antioxidant Moisturizer is the perfect addition to your private label skin care like, as it is made from high-quality, natural ingredients. Antioxidants from green tea, bayberry, blueberry, cranberry and seabuckthorn in this skin care formulation help halt and reverse environmental damage via the suppression of damaging free radicals. Furthermore, ingredients like squalane, lactic and glycolic acids, alpha lipoic acid and peptides add anti-aging benefits. This private label skin care formula is potent yet gentle and is an excellent daily anti-pollution solution.

