ask enriched with botanical herbs, Aloe vera extract, Pomegranate Extract, Bearberry extract. It reduces the transfer of melanin to the skin, making skin fairer, smoother and softer.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply on wet face and neck, gently massage with circular movements, wash off with water.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Add 2-3 drops of Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum with the cream to apply all over face &amp; neck. Moisten hand with cold water, gently massage for 10-15 minutes &amp; remove with damp cotton.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add 2-3 drop in Massage Cream &amp; Face Pack. Also apply after facial for extra glow.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply on cleanse face, gently massage the gel. Avoid contact with eyes.</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply on face and neck, Avoiding Eyes, let it dry Wash off with plain water.</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Cetostearyl Alcohol</li><li>Light Liquid Paraffin</li><li>Glyceryl Monostearate</li><li>Aloe Vera Extract</li><li>Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter)</li><li>Sesame Oil</li><li>Cetyl Alcohol</li><li>Polyethylene Scrub</li><li>Stearic Acid</li><li>Mulberry (Morus alba) Extract</li><li>Liquorice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Polysorbate 80</li><li>Glyceryl Stearate</li><li>Polyethylene Glycol 100 Stearate</li><li>Perfume</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Methylparaben</li><li>Propylparaben</li><li>Allantoin</li><li>Disodium Ethylenediaminetetra Acetic Acid</li><li>Beeswax Bleached</li><li>Sweet Almond</li><li>(Prunus amygdalus</li><li>dulcis) Oil</li><li>Emulsifying Wax</li><li>Isopropyl Myristate</li><li>Papaya (Carica papaya) Extract</li><li>Cyclomethicone</li><li>Tomato (Solanum lycopersicum) Fruit Extract</li><li>Carrot Extract</li><li>Fenugreek (Ingonella foenumgraecum) Extract</li><li>Xylitylglucoside</li><li>Anhydroxylitol</li><li>Xylitol</li><li>Vitamin E</li><li>Liqourice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Green Tea (Camellia sinensis) Extract</li><li>Sodium Acrylates Copolymer</li></ul><h4>Important Considerations</h4><p><strong>Note:</strong> Use only as directed. Avoid contact with eyes. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a physician.</p>";}i:360;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:153;s:4:"slug";s:39:"pearl-skin-whitening-therapy-facial-kit";s:4:"name";s:43:"PEARL SKIN WHITENING THERAPY – FACIAL KIT";s:8:"category";s:32:"private-label-skin-care-products";s:11:"subcategory";s:12:"facials-kits";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";d:4.5;s:7:"reviews";i:0;s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:63:"uploads/products/pearl-skin-whitening-therapy-facial-kit/01.jpg";s:11:"description";s:3779:"<h3>Description</h3><ul class="desc-steps"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> – Pearl Gentle Exfoliating Facial Scrub : This Scrub consist of botanical herbs, Aloe vera extract, Neem Extract, Manjiestha extract and Liquorice ( Glycyrhiza Glabra) Extract to prevent skin from acne and pimples. This Oil control Scrub penetrate deep into the skin to clean clogged pores and removes Pimples and acne leaving you with a clean, soft and smooth skin .</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Pearl Energizing Cream: Pearl energizing cream help to improve blood circulation restore softness and smoothness. This excellent energizing cream improves cell regeneration and clear pimple and skin eruption. The cream nourishes, hydrates and rejuvenate the skin.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum Moisturises the skin, give extra radiance and instant whitening.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Pearl Massage Gel Pearl Massage Gel helps improve blood circulation restore softness and radiance. The excellent gel improve the quality of cell regeneration and glowing white, making skin younger.</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Pearl Whitening Mask : The absolute oil control mask enriched with herbal extract, Aloevera Extract, Bearberry Extract, Chamomile Extract, Pomegranate extract, cinnamon Leaf extract and pearl powder. It reduces pimple and acne on the skin making skin fairer, clearer and softer.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply this scrub lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes, wash off with plain water .</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Add 2-3 drops of Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum with the cream to apply all over face &amp; neck. Moisten hand with cold water, gently massage for 10-15 minutes &amp; remove with damp cotton.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add 2-3 drop in Massage Cream &amp; Face Pack. Also apply after facial for extra glow.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply this gel lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes .</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply a generous amount of this pack on face and neck leaving eyes. Relax till completely dry. Rinse with plain water .</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Light Liquid Paraffin</li><li>Cetostearyl Alcohol</li><li>Glyceryl Monostearate</li><li>Aloe Vera Extract</li><li>Scrub Beads</li><li>Neem ( Azadirachta indica) Extract</li><li>Manjistha (Rubia cordifolia) Extract</li><li>Polysorbate 80</li><li>Liquorice ( Glycymhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Glyceryl Stearate</li><li>Polyethylene Glycol 100 Stearate</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Methylparaben</li><li>Cinnamon Oil</li><li>Fragrance</li><li>Allantoin</li><li>Propylparaben</li><li>Hydrolyzed Pearl</li><li>Beeswax Bleached</li><li>Emulsifying Wax</li><li>Sweet Almond (Prunus amygdalus dulcis) Oil</li><li>Isopropyl Myristate</li><li>Cetyl Alcohol</li><li>Neem ( Azadirachta</li><li>indica) Extract</li><li>Polyethylene Glycol</li><li>Calendula (Calendula Officinalis) Extract</li><li>Turmeric Extract</li><li>Xylityglucoside</li><li>Vitamin E</li><li>Anhydroxylitol</li><li>Xylitol</li><li>Liqourice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Papaya (Carica papaya) Extract</li><li>Green Tea (Camellia sinensis) Extract</li><li>Sodium Acrylates Copolymer</li><li>Glycolic Acid</li><li>Xylityiglucoside</li></ul><h4>Important Considerations</h4><p><strong>Note:</strong> Use only as directed. Avoid contact with eyes. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a physician.</p>";}i:361;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:152;s:4:"slug";s:33:"gold-skin-glow-therapy-facial-kit";s:4:"name";s:37:"GOLD SKIN GLOW THERAPY – FACIAL KIT";s:8:"category";s:32:"private-label-skin-care-products";s:11:"subcategory";s:12:"facials-kits";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";d:4.5;s:7:"reviews";i:0;s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:57:"uploads/products/gold-skin-glow-therapy-facial-kit/01.jpg";s:11:"description";s:3659:"<h3>Description</h3><ul class="desc-steps"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> – Gold Gel Scrub: This 24-carat gold gel scrub will help reveal a smoother, clearer and youthful skin. The excellent gel having soft granules penetrate deep into the skin to clean clogged pores and removes black head from skin and skin restores softness, smoothness and radiance.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Gold Massage Cream : This 24-carat gold Massage cream that helps improve blood circulation restore softness smoothness and radiance. The excellent Massage cream improve the quality of cell regeneration and glow while making skin look younger .</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum Moisturises the skin, give extra radiance and instant whitening.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Gold Radiance Massage Gel : This 24-carat gold radiance gel helps to improve blood circulation restore softness, smoothness and radiance. The excellent gel improves the quality of cell regeneration and glow while making skin look younger.</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Gold Pack : This Gold pack contains natural extract of Liquorice Extract, Mulberry extract, aloevera extract and other precious ingredients Gold Foil that lighten the skin and control production of melanin &amp; making skin fairer and lighten facial tone.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply this gel scrub lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes, Wash off with plain water.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Add 2-3 drops of Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum with the cream to apply all over face &amp; neck. Moisten hand with cold water, gently massage for 10-15 minutes &amp; remove with damp cotton.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add 2-3 drop in Massage Cream &amp; Face Pack. Also apply after facial for extra glow.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply this gel lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes .</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply a generous amount of this pack on face and neck leaving eyes. Relax till completely dry. Rinse with plain water .</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Propylene Glycol</li><li>Turmeric Extract</li><li>Liquorice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Scrub beads</li><li>Xylityglucoside</li><li>Mulberry (Morus alba)</li><li>Extract</li><li>PEG 12 Dimethicone</li><li>Carbomer</li><li>Trethanolamine</li><li>Polysorbate 20</li><li>Cinnamon Oil</li><li>Imidazolidinyl Urea</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Perfume</li><li>Anhydroxylitol</li><li>Xylitol</li><li>24K Gold flakes</li><li>Disodium Ethylenediaminetetra Acetic Acid</li><li>Light Liquid Paraffin</li><li>Beeswax Bleached</li><li>Emulsifying Wax</li><li>